  "vibe": "Parchment #efe4cf and sepia #4a3826 with a rust compass red #a8402e, a muted sea blue #6a92a8 and gold. Young Serif's chunky old-style caps run in sentence case over Assistant; titles only drowse up, and the camera drifts five pixels — the stillest frame in this set. The backdrop is a chart being made: a faint sepia graticule rules the whole frame, a sea-tinted landmass sits under a hand-inked outline, and a rust dashed voyage route draws itself across the frame in step with the scene's own progress, its arrowhead appearing only once the line has finished. A compass rose rocks at the lower right, and a sea serpent bobs beside the italic words hic sunt dracones. Type sets one jittering character at a time; a cartouche flies in and locks into its slot with a shake.",
